---
---
<section id="about" style="padding: 7rem 1.5rem; background: var(--color-bg);">
  <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: center;">

      <!-- Left: text -->
      <div>
        <p class="section-label reveal" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">About me</p>
        <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          John Billekens,<br/>
          <span style="color: var(--color-navy);">IT specialist</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          Born in 1981 and based in Noord-Brabant, the Netherlands. Over 24 years in IT,
          specialising in <strong style="color: var(--color-prussian);">End User Computing (EUC)</strong> and
          <strong style="color: var(--color-prussian);">Digital Workspace</strong> solutions since 2013.
        </p>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          As a freelance consultant I help organisations optimise their virtual workplaces.
          I combine deep technical expertise with a pragmatic approach: no unnecessary complexity,
          just working solutions that fit your organisation.
        </p>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          Alongside consultancy work I maintain a technical blog at
          <a href="https://blog.j81.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--color-navy); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">blog.j81.nl</a>
          and share scripts and knowledge with the broader IT community.
        </p>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: visual card -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2" style="position: relative;">
        <div style="
          background: var(--color-prussian);
          border-radius: 1rem;
          padding: 2.5rem;
          position: relative;
          overflow: hidden;
        ">
          <div class="dot-grid" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.2;"></div>

          <div style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
            <img src="/logo.png" alt="JOBICO logo" style="width: 5rem; height: auto; margin-bottom: 2rem; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);" />

            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                <div style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; background: rgba(178,235,242,0.12); border-radius: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B2EBF2" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; color: white; font-size: 0.9rem;">EUC & Digital Workspace</p>
                  <p style="color: rgba(178,235,242,0.65); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.2rem;">Specialist since 2013</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                <div style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; background: rgba(178,235,242,0.12); border-radius: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B2EBF2" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; color: white; font-size: 0.9rem;">Citrix & NetScaler</p>
                  <p style="color: rgba(178,235,242,0.65); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.2rem;">Configuration & support</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;">
                <div style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; background: rgba(178,235,242,0.12); border-radius: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B2EBF2" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; color: white; font-size: 0.9rem;">Scripting & Automation</p>
                  <p style="color: rgba(178,235,242,0.65); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.2rem;">Deployment & management</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Accent square -->
        <div aria-hidden="true" style="
          position: absolute;
          bottom: -1.5rem; right: -1.5rem;
          width: 6rem; height: 6rem;
          background: var(--color-blizzard);
          border-radius: 0.5rem;
          z-index: -1;
        "></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #about > div > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 3rem !important;
    }
  }
</style>
